       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Generate a priced quote for the following requested items with a 35% markup: \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- 10,000 sheets of A4 paper, \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- 5,000 sheets of A3 paper, \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                 </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- 500 reams of printer paper. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Note that A4 sheets have been restocked to sufficient levels for fulfillment, \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"but A3 sheets and printer paper reams are not found in inventory and require external sourcing, so </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">availability is limited. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                         </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    f\"Requested delivery by {delivery_date}. Request date is {request_date}.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">quote_response = quoting_agent(task=task_quote, additional_args={\"items\": requested_items, \"inventory_info\": </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory_response})</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">print(quote_response)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
