       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Thought: Both requested items have sufficient stock and no restocking is needed. Next, I will call quoting_agent to</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">generate a price quote for the order with a 35% markup. Then I will call order_agent to fulfill the order.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">         </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
