       "<pre style=\"white-space:pre;overflow-x:auto;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',consolas,'Courier New',monospace\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic\">Output message of the LLM:</span> <span style=\"color: #d4b702; text-decoration-color: #d4b702\">────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Thought: This is a customer order request. Per the mandatory workflow, I need to first check inventory for all </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">requested items, then generate a quote with 35% markup for them, and finally fulfill the order with the </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">order_agent. The items and quantity are clearly specified, and there's a delivery date mentioned April 15, 2025, </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">with a request date April 7, 2025. I will start by asking the inventory_agent to check stock for these items.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">items_requested = [</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    {\"item_name\": \"glossy A4 paper sheets\", \"quantity\": 500},</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    {\"item_name\": \"matte A3 paper sheets\", \"quantity\": 1000},</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    {\"item_name\": \"poster boards 24x36\", \"quantity\": 300},</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                         </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    {\"item_name\": \"heavyweight cardstock sheets\", \"quantity\": 200}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                 </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">]</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #79c0ff; text-decoration-color: #79c0ff; background-color: #0d1117; font-weight: bold\"># Create a stock check task description for inventory agent</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory_task = \"Check current stock levels for the following items with quantities: \" + \", \".join(</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    [f\"{item['quantity']} x {item['item_name']}\" for item in items_requested]</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory_response = inventory_agent(task=inventory_task, additional_args={\"request_date\": \"2025-04-07\"})</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">          </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">print(inventory_response)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                          </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
      ],
